You also need to add the 'Y' to lev_comp.l, into this line:
"<MAPC>[-|}{+ABCISHKPLWTF\\#. 0123456789]*\r?\n  {"

That's all characters recognized as type MAPC by the lexer,
followed by newline. Two other rules in that file tell
where MAPC characters can show up: between MAP and ENDMAP.

